00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.000
PARESH KHARYA: You're welcome.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:01.490
MELANIE WARRICK: Thank you.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.960
PARESH KHARYA: I appreciate it.

